# Plan file conventions

Authoritative reference: [`docs/plans/README.md`](mdc:docs/plans/README.md).
Plans follow the [Ralphex](https://ralphex.com/docs/) skeleton.

## Non-negotiables

- **Mandatory Plan policy header.** Every plan starts with the verbatim
  blockquote from `README.md` § Plan file format. Don't paraphrase.
- **Filename:** `<NNNN>-<verb>-<subject>.md`. Pick the next free number
  by listing `docs/plans/[0-9]*.md docs/plans/completed/[0-9]*.md
  docs/plans/backlog/[0-9]*.md | tail`. Don't reuse retired numbers.
- **Checkboxes only inside `### Task N:` sections.** Overview, Context,
  Validation Commands stay checkbox-free. The last item of every task
  is `- [ ] Mark completed`.
- **`## Validation Commands` is machine-readable.** One shell command
  per bullet, runnable end-to-end without further setup.
- **Architecture-first.** If the plan touches a layer with no note in
  `docs/plans/architecture/`, write the note first as a separate task
  (or separate prerequisite plan) and link to it from
  `## Context / References`.
- **Every commit produced for the plan carries a `Plan: <NNNN>`
  trailer.** Trailer is the **ID only**, not the slug. Multi-plan
  commits get one trailer per plan, on separate lines.

## Closure ritual

Last task is always close-out:

```markdown
### Task N: Close-out
- [ ] Run all Validation Commands locally; all pass.
- [ ] `git log --grep='Plan: <NNNN>'` shows the full commit set.
- [ ] `git mv docs/plans/<NNNN>-<slug>.md docs/plans/completed/`.
- [ ] Update the row in `plan-control-index.md` to point at `completed/`.
- [ ] Mark completed
```

Plans in `docs/plans/completed/` are immutable historical records.
Don't edit them after the move.

## Paired docs (strategies)

A plan that adds a new strategy under
`backend/services/strategies/` always lands together with a new
`docs/strategies/<kebab-case-slug>.md`. The plan's task list must
include that artefact explicitly — both the code file and the
Ukrainian operator doc — and the agent has full edit permissions
to write the doc directly. Match the section skeleton in sibling
docs (`basic.md`, `news-edge.md`, `weather-distribution.md`):
Сутність / Контракт / Логіка детекції / Логіка виходу /
Налаштування за замовчуванням / Коли НЕ працює / Посилання.

A plan that **deletes** a strategy must also delete the matching
doc in the same commit. Orphan docs are bugs.

## Architecture notes

- Live in `docs/plans/architecture/`, contain **no tasks**.
- Each note ends with `Last verified: YYYY-MM-DD` (introduced in
  plan 0013). Bump when a real diff against code is performed.
- Recommended sections: Purpose / Key files / Contracts /
  Dependencies (both directions) / Extension points.

